{"study_accession":"PRJNA957898","secondary_study_accession":"SRP433649","title":"Systems immunology-based drug repurposing framework to target inflammation in atherosclerosis [DRUG_RNA-seq]","description":"we present a novel path to drug repurposing to identify new immunotherapies for ASCVD. The integration of time of-flight mass cytometry (CyTOF) and RNA-sequencing identified unique inflammatory signatures in peripheral blood mononuclear cells (PBMCs) stimulated with ASCVD plasma. By comparing these inflammatory signatures to large-scale gene expression data from the LINCS L1000 dataset, we identified drugs that could reverse this inflammatory response. In conclusion, a systems immunology-driven drug repurposing with pre- clinical validation strategy can aid the development of new cardiovascular immunotherapies. Overall design: Comparative gene expression profiling analysis of RNA-seq data for healthy donors pbmcs stimulated with patient plasma -/+ selected compounds.","pubmed":"37771373","geo_series":"","n_samples":36,"samples":[{"sample_accession":"SAMN34272403","study_accession":"PRJNA957898","blood_class":"plasma_serum_cfrna","class_from":"sample","title":"Sample26_VEHICLE_Exp_60716_S77","description":"Sample26_VEHICLE_Exp_60716_S77","sex":"","geo_sample":"GSM7196585","access":"open","dbgap":"","n_runs":1,"first_public":"2023-05-05","attributes":[["source_name","peripheral blood mononuclear cells"],["cell_type","peripheral blood mononuclear cells"],["treatment","plasma stimulation + vehicle"]],"runs":[{"run_accession":"SRR24234908","experiment_accession":"SRX20031150","library_layout":"PAIRED","library_selection":"cDNA","instrument_model":"Illumina NovaSeq 6000","read_count":34602448,"base_count":3529449696,"first_public":"2023-05-05","experiment_title":"Illumina NovaSeq 6000 sequencing: GSM7196585: Sample26_VEHICLE_Exp_60716_S77 Homo sapiens RNA-Seq"}],"labels":[]},{"sample_accession":"SAMN34272404","study_accession":"PRJNA957898","blood_class":"plasma_serum_